:01:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T10:01:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T10:50:00Z","overview":"Tony and his friend, world-renowned chef Eric Ripert, explore the far reaches of indigenous Andes in search of a rare variety of wild cocoa that is said to be the \"best\" in the world.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T10:50:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T10:50:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T11:39:00Z","overview":"Few countries have a more contentious relationship with the United States than Iran. In this episode we heads to this Shia Muslim nation to explore a country few Americans have visited since the 80s.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T11:39:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T11:39:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T12:28:00Z","overview":"In this episode of Parts Unknown, we first visit the city of Glasgow, then we head north into the Scottish Highlands.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T12:28:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:28:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:16:00Z","overview":"The two funniest and most brilliant chef/restaurateurs in Canada, Joe Beef's Dave McMillan and Fred Morin, take Tony across Canada by rail.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T13:16:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:16:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:07:00Z","overview":"Tony travels to Tokyo in search of the city's dark, extreme underside.","genres":["Series","Food & Cooking"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T14:07:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:07:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:55:00Z","overview":"Tony explores what Burroughs called \"Interzone,\" where artists sought escape from Western moral prohibitions and the possibilities of great empty spaces. But what is it like now?","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T14:55:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:55:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:44:00Z","overview":"Tony travels to Mexico City and Oaxaca to meet who fight for the food, the art, and the lives they believe in. In the Santa Anita neighbourhood of Mexico City, Tony meets boxer Jorge Lacierva.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T15:44:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:44:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:33:00Z","overview":"In this episode, we leave behind Africa we’ve come to know in the news. Instead, we embrace the wild, untamed land of mystery, adventure, and exoticism; Zanzibar.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T16:33:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:33:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:24:00Z","overview":"Anthony Bourdain explores the vibrant, dynamic city of Shanghai.","genres":["Series","Food & Cooking"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T17:24:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:24:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:12:00Z","overview":"New Mexico has the largest Hispanic population per capita in the US. No better way to see the mash-up of cultures that make up this uniquely American State, than by what the people here are eating","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T18:12:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:12:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:03:00Z","overview":"Tony explores Copenhagen, the economic and cultural center of Denmark.","genres":["Series","Food & Cooking"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T19:03:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:03:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:52:00Z","overview":"In this episode of Parts Unknown Tony explores a few of the many faces of Miami. Chef Michelle Bernstein takes Tony out to an authentic Cuban breakfast and a late-night dinner at a gas station café in Doral.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T19:52:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:52:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:40:00Z","overview":"Detroit holds a unique place in American history. Few cities have seen such a dramatic rise and fall from economic boom to disparity. Tony explores the past, present and future of the Motor City.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T20:40:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:40:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:29:00Z","overview":"A country of only six million people where a vast percentage of the land is steaming hot jungle or a huge scrub desert known simply as The Chaco. This is one of the least known nations in the world.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T21:29:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T21:29:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T22:17:00Z","overview":"Once Johannesburg was the most dangerous city in the world, but the end of the apartheid has lead to vast changes in the city. Tony visits the Johannesburg suburb of Hillbrow, and discovers the culture and, of course food.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T22:17:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T22:17:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:05:00Z","overview":"With the slight relaxation of control by the government of Myanmar, Tony is finally able to explore one of the most fabled and beautiful areas of Asia.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T23:05:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:05:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T23:53:00Z","overview":"Israel, the West Bank and Gaza are three locations Tony has never travelled to before.The intense and fraught relationship between these places is hard to understand but Tony will attempt to delve into the lives of those who live here, through their food.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-28T23:53:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:53:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:42:00Z","overview":"After eight years, Tony returns to South Korea. And this time, he’s no stranger to kimchi. But just as Tony has changed, so has Korea.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown","released":"2026-11-29T00:42:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:42:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","overview":"Tony will explore several regions of Colombia from the mountains down to the Caribbean coast to the coca leaf growing inlands formerly controlled by drug cartels.","genres":["Series","Documentary"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown – Live","released":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T01:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts Unknown – Live","released":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T06:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_AnthonyBourdainPartsUnknown_us","title":"Anthony Bourdain: Parts